    <briefdescription>
<para>One compiled Shadertoy-compatible shader pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns an OpenGLShaderProgram, caches the Shadertoy minimum uniform locations (iResolution, iTime, iTimeDelta, iFrame), and draws a fullscreen quad per render call.</para>
<para><ref refid="structshader_1_1_pass_1af67411e5658785759c900808b548e962" kindref="member">compile()</ref> prepends shadertoy_uniforms.frag and appends shadertoy_main.frag from <ref refid="namespaceBinaryData" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">BinaryData</ref>, then translates via OpenGLHelpers::translateFragmentShaderToV3 for GL version portability.</para>
<para>Thread contract: ALL methods GL THREAD only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
